{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"crystal","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Crystal","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Crystal (.cr).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"crystal","name":"Crystal","extensions":[".cr"],"grammar":"grammars/crystal.json","lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Crystal","path":"snippets/crystal.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/crystal.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`(?:[^`\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*`\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \":[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*[?!]?\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@@?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:instance_sizeof|uninitialized|annotation|pointerof|protected|abstract|verbatim|include|private|require|ensure|extend|module|rescue|return|select|sizeof|struct|typeof|unless|alias|begin|break|class|elsif|macro|super|union|until|while|yield|case|else|enum|next|nil\\\\?|self|then|type|when|with|asm|def|end|for|fun|lib|out|as|do|if|in|of)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Float64|String|Symbol|Int32|Int64|UInt8|Array|Range|Tuple|Bool|Char|Hash|Proc|Nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:print|raise|spawn|puts|loop|pp|p)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/crystal.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Method\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"def ${1:name}(${2:arg})\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A method\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}\",\n      \"  def initialize(${2:arg})\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"  end\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Each\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"each\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:items}.each do |${2:item}|\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"each\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"struct ${1:Name}\",\n      \"  property ${2:field} : ${3:String}\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Crystal\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Crystal.\n\n## Files\n\n`.cr`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `def` | A method |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `each` | each |\n| `struct` | A struct |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}